fwNKWAxWIQ_UHHfXdA2YQ3YcHCLsBKAE"]]],null,"附近的停車場",null,"0ahUKEwi9_P3fwNKWAxWIQ_UHHfXdA2YQ3IcHCLkBKAw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_TIPS"],"分享停車相關資訊",null,null,"請提供停車場地點和停車位數量等資訊","停車場",null,"0ahUKEwi9_P3fwNKWAxWIQ_UHHfXdA2YQ3IcHCLwBKA0",null,null,["騎機車建議去附近公園停，這條路上臨停有機會被拖吊"],null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwi9_P3fwNKWAxWIQ_UHHfXdA2YQ3YcHCL4BKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwi9_P3fwNKWAxWIQ_UHHfXdA2YQ3IcHCL0BKA4",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["一間平價高CP值的台式口味拉麵店！\n\n2025.04.16初訪\n門口拿菜單後入座點餐\n餐前結帳 餐具需自取\n平日中午前來，無需等待，且出餐速度很快\n店內貼了許多告示與提醒 放著日本流行樂\n即便沒開冷氣 電風扇吹著也不至於悶熱 呈現一種獨特氛圍\n\n這次點的是味噌湯頭+辛辣，若是沒在吃辣的人不推薦，因為真的滿辣的！\n但也讓湯頭變得很香很有勁道，推薦可以吃吃看！\n牛肉本身有點韌，咬需要花點力氣。友人點叉燒，他說他會給叉燒四顆星\n如果在附近找不到想吃的店，可以來這裡試試看\n有機會會回訪～",null,[0,31]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5129299439050785876/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTnZaM1JoWVZkQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5129299439050785876/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTnZaM1JoWVZkQkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/5129299439050785876/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTnZaM1JoWVZkQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5129299439050785876/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTnZaM1JoWVZkQkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5129299439050785876/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTnZaM1JoWVZkQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5129299439050785876/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVTnZaM1JoWVZkQkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,7169,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNvZ3RhYVdBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xea812333d08171e1!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgMCogtaaWA%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"]