SUNSMkpTc2ZBEAE"]],"CIHM0ogKEICAgICR2JSswgE",1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["這家小屁拉麵店真是太讓人驚艷了！從菜單上的選擇就能感受到它的豐富多樣性，而且每一種拉麵的味道都是獨具特色。我們嘗試了雪花牛味增拉麵、叉燒味增拉麵和什錦豚骨拉麵，每一種都讓我們忍不住舔舐嘴唇，嘴裡充滿了滿滿的美味。雪花牛味增拉麵的牛肉肉質嫩滑，味增湯頭口感豐富，讓人感覺像在享受一道高級料理。叉燒味增拉麵的叉燒肉質柔軟，與濃郁的味增湯頭完美結合，口感極佳。什錦豚骨拉麵的湯頭濃郁，豚肉入口即化，讓人回味無窮。\n\n除了拉麵本身，店家還提供了豐富的配料選擇，可以讓食客根據自己的口味進行搭配。我們點了加辣的雪花牛味增拉麵，辣度恰到好處，非常適合喜歡辣味的食客。此外，還有青蔥、韭菜花等蔬菜配料，為拉麵增添了新鮮的口感和清新的風味。\n\n總之，我們在這家小屁拉麵店度過了一個非常愉快的用餐體驗。食物美味，服務態度親切，價格也非常實惠。如果你還沒有嘗試過這家店，那麼我極度推薦你去嚐一嚐！我敢保證，這裡的美味一定會讓你流連忘返，直到再次造訪為止！",null,[0,203]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5129299439050785876/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlNNa3BUYzJaQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5129299439050785876/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlNNa3BUYzJaQkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/5129299439050785876/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlNNa3BUYzJaQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5129299439050785876/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlNNa3BUYzJaQkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5129299439050785876/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlNNa3BUYzJaQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5129299439050785876/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlNNa3BUYzJaQkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,6863,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNSMkpTc2ZBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xea812333d08171e1!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICR2JSsfA%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNSMkpTc2ZBEAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNSMkpTc2ZBEi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ1IySlNzX0FFEhNDZ3dJdXVfMm9BWVEtTGluaVFNGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ1IySlNzQWcSE0Nnd0l1dV8yb0FZUS1MaW5pUU0iEgkAAAAAAAAAABHhcYHQMyOB6ioLMFo2UVR1bDl